[implements `FormatFields`]: super::FmtContext#impl-FormatFields<'writer>
[ANSI terminal escape codes]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ANSI_escape_code
[`Writer::has_ansi_escapes`]: Writer::has_ansi_escapes
